{"id":"MOEX-115020-1301-Q043","title":"第43題","version":"3","batch":"115-1-med1","sourceSha256":"83caeb074a3001d989dad1f13efa1c9a0111d9ae6ec906987e0b1d1292790a52","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_e9d27be527fc81919b299e5c3b42557c","sourceAnchor":"MOEX-115020-1301-Q043","shortHtml":"<div><p>既有題庫解析（作者未另標示）</p><div><div><div><div><div><p>絲狀乳頭是舌背數量最多、最小的乳頭，主要具有機械摩擦功能，通常不含味蕾。蕈狀、輪廓與葉狀乳頭較與味覺相關。</p></div></div></div></div></div></div>","html":"<div><div><h2>第43題</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\"><b>原題答案：</b>A</p></div><div><div><div><h3>為什麼選 A？</h3><p>絲狀乳頭在舌背廣泛分布，細長而小、數量最多，以角化表面增加摩擦、協助處理食物；它不含味蕾。因此本題選 A。</p><p>這題的兩個線索要一起看：「最多」是舌背密布的絲狀乳頭；「最小」也是教材的典型形態描述。不要與數量少而大的輪廓乳頭混淆，也不要把舌乳頭等同味蕾，因為絲狀乳頭的主要功能是機械作用。</p></div><figure><div><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:300px;--reviewed-image-ratio:0.974025974025974\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/e44ac2b9f40aa155c8bdd3070fd9bd0ced54dc9402631940b87115b52a9edb07.png\" alt=\"舌乳頭的歷史形態圖\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"308\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/e44ac2b9f40aa155c8bdd3070fd9bd0ced54dc9402631940b87115b52a9edb07.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a></div><figcaption><p>Gray 1018 舌黏膜局部示意：細長、尖端角化的突起是絲狀乳頭；圓頂、蘑菇形的突起為蕈狀乳頭。此圖用於形態比較。</p></figcaption></figure><div><div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><caption>四種舌乳頭的外觀與味蕾</caption><thead><tr><th>乳頭</th><th>典型外觀／位置</th><th>味蕾與功能</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>絲狀乳頭</td><td>細長、尖錐形；舌背廣泛分布</td><td>不含味蕾；機械摩擦，數量最多且細小</td></tr><tr><td>蕈狀乳頭</td><td>蘑菇形，散在絲狀乳頭間，舌尖較多</td><td>頂端可含味蕾</td></tr><tr><td>輪廓乳頭</td><td>較大，界溝前方呈 V 形排列，周圍有溝</td><td>味蕾在溝的側壁；漿液腺開口入溝</td></tr><tr><td>葉狀乳頭</td><td>舌後外側的平行黏膜摺疊</td><td>摺疊側壁含味蕾，成人通常較不顯著</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><figure><div><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:450px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.991150442477876\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/1e18cd6243e8017af1abe93646a7b2d54ffa69824c4fb5ea5087a4e27c70876e.png\" alt=\"舌乳頭的歷史形態圖\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"450\" height=\"226\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/1e18cd6243e8017af1abe93646a7b2d54ffa69824c4fb5ea5087a4e27c70876e.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a></div><figcaption><p>Gray 1015 輪廓乳頭縱切面：中央為大型乳頭，兩側有深溝；側壁可見味蕾與往下連接的神經。可用它與絲狀乳頭的細小尖錐形比較。</p></figcaption></figure><div><h3>逐項判讀</h3><dl><dt>A</dt><dd>正確。絲狀乳頭數量最多、細小，角化與摩擦功能是重要辨認線索。</dd><dt>B</dt><dd>蕈狀乳頭為圓頂蘑菇形，散在絲狀乳頭間，數目較少且體積較大。</dd><dt>C</dt><dd>輪廓乳頭數目少而大，周圍有溝，側壁富含味蕾，與題目相反。</dd><dt>D</dt><dd>葉狀乳頭呈舌側黏膜摺疊，不是密布舌背的微小絲狀構造。</dd></dl></div><div><h3>味蕾和腺體常一起考</h3><p>輪廓乳頭周圍的溝接受馮艾布納腺（von Ebner glands）的漿液分泌，有助沖洗溝內物質，讓味蕾接觸新的味物質。味蕾是上皮內的感覺細胞群，不是一整個乳頭；同一乳頭可以含許多味蕾，而絲狀乳頭沒有味蕾。</p></div><details><summary>來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=115020&amp;q=1&amp;s=0101&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部115年第一次醫師一階醫學（一）原試題</a>：原題、四個選項與答案另依正式答案鍵核對</li><li><a href=\"https://embryology.med.unsw.edu.au/embryology/index.php/Histology_and_Embryology_1941_-_Histology_3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Histology and Embryology 1941 - Histology 3, UNSW Embryology</a></li><li><a href=\"https://histology.siu.edu/erg/giguide.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Histology at SIU: Gastrointestinal System</a></li><li><a href=\"https://histology.siu.edu/erg/oralcav.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Oral Cavity — Histology at SIU</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.imaios.com/en/e-anatomy/anatomical-structures/lingual-papillae-1541091992\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">IMAIOS: Lingual papillae — Muhammad A. Javaid</a></li><li><a href=\"https://histology.leeds.ac.uk/home/oral/tongue/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tongue, University of Leeds Histology Guide</a>：乳頭形態、味蕾及von Ebner腺</li><li>圖：<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gray1015.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Gray1015.png</a>；Henry Vandyke Carter；Gray’s Anatomy 1918；<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Public domain / PD-scan</a>；原圖像素未改動，另附中文圖說</li><li>圖：<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gray1018.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Gray1018.png</a>；Henry Vandyke Carter；Gray’s Anatomy 1918；<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Public domain / PD-scan</a>；原圖像素未改動，另附中文圖說</li></ul></details></div></div></div>","imageCount":2,"sourceAnswer":"原題答案：A"}